I’d give an AI-nime the same grace I give a school play. I can see the cardboard castle and still want to know whether the prince makes it home.

If his sleeve changes color and I barely register it, the scene still works. If I miss the look his wife gives him because I’m distracted by her hand melting into the peach, that shot is worth another pass. And if the thunder is hilariously over the top and makes me want to watch episode two, keep the thunder.